          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The 40-year-old two-time Oscar nominee (photo) will guest co-host “Today with Jenna & Friends” for a week later this month, Jenna Bush Hager told People. The Marvel superstar’s gig will kick off Jan. 20.",
