        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The pair’s similarities include being “big reader[s], which will be so much fun,” as well as the fact that both are fraternal twins – Bush Hager with sister Barbara and Johansson with brother Hunter. Both are also moms to young daughters.",
