        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Rumors had swirled for months that Jackson, 56, and Foster, 49, were seeing each other after both announced separations from their longtime spouses. The duo had obvious chemistry when they starred in the Broadway revival of “The Music Man” in 2022.",
